{% comment %}
  Cartel "Photo coming soon" tile — the branded stand-in for a product with no media.

  Replaces `placeholder_svg_tag: '<class>'` at every product-media surface in the
  theme. Shopify's own placeholders draw apparel (product-1 is a backpack), which
  read as a mistake on a lash-supply store — and at 597px in the PDP hero the
  backpack was the largest thing on the page. Every product in the step-16 import
  lands photo-less and 18 stay that way, so this is the default state of the
  catalogue, not an edge case.

  Accepts:
  - ph_size:  'lg' | 'md' | 'sm' | 'xs'  (default 'md')
              lg = PDP hero (350-597px) · md = card grids (~230-300px)
              sm = cart lines (74-90px)  · xs = upsell + search chips (44-52px)
              Only lg and md carry the label; below ~100px the mark stands alone.
  - ph_class: the surface's own sizing class — 'card-photo', 'line-photo',
              'gal-ph' and so on. Pass it through unchanged: those rules own the
              positioning (absolute-fill vs flow-fill vs fixed 52px) and this
              snippet deliberately does not duplicate them. The shared `.clph`
              rules in cartel-home.css carry a doubled class so they still win
              the background/padding/display reset against the per-template
              sheets, which load after it.

  Usage:
  {% render 'cartel-photo-placeholder', ph_size: 'lg', ph_class: 'gal-ph' %}
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign clph_size = ph_size | default: 'md'
  assign clph_class = ph_class | default: ''
-%}
<span class="clph clph--{{ clph_size }}{% if clph_class != blank %} {{ clph_class }}{% endif %}">
  {%- comment -%}
    Lash fan over a lid arc. Stroke-only and currentColor so one mark tints and
    scales from 26px to 200px; stroke width is pinned in px per size via
    vector-effect, so it stays optically even instead of ballooning on the hero.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <svg class="clph-m" viewBox="0 0 64 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    <path d="M5 28C18 12 46 12 59 28"/>
    <path d="M11.8 21.9C9.5 17 7 13 5.5 9"/>
    <path d="M19.9 17.9C18.3 13.5 16.8 9.5 15.5 5.5"/>
    <path d="M25.9 16.5C25 12 24.2 8 23.6 4"/>
    <path d="M32 16C32 11.5 32 7.5 32 3"/>
    <path d="M38.1 16.5C39 12 39.8 8 40.4 4"/>
    <path d="M44.1 17.9C45.7 13.5 47.2 9.5 48.5 5.5"/>
    <path d="M52.2 21.9C54.5 17 57 13 58.5 9"/>
  </svg>
  {%- if clph_size == 'lg' or clph_size == 'md' -%}
    <span class="clph-l">Photo coming soon</span>
  {%- endif -%}
</span>
